# variation 1 of b06: the error code of the aspect is the code of the raise
** spec: semantics/aspects.md#what-an-aspect-is
primary aspect b06_test1 is
  process main is
    apply fail();
    print "never";
  recover
    expect $error.code == $err_io;
    print "io error: {$error.message}";
  return;
end b06_test1;
